            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Element Name</td><td>Type</td><td>Semantics</td></tr><tr><td>ServiceID</td><td>simpleType:xs:unsignedShort</td><td>Unique identifier of the service</td></tr><tr><td>FreeService</td><td>simpleType:xs:boolean</td><td>This element is used by the SECC to indicate if a service can be used by the EVCC free of charge or not. If FreeService is equal to true, the EV can use the offered service without an additional cost. If FreeService is equal to false, the service, if used by the EV, will be billed using the method negotiated during the authorization phase.</td></tr></table>",
